## Program Outcome

Every Tool Shed installation and supported upgrade path converges the workspace to the selected
release's complete safely reachable feature set, or preserves one coherent fallback authority and
reports exact unavailable capabilities and recovery actions. Authority, runtime mutation ability,
document relationships, semantic state, and feature availability agree across all consumers. The
contract is field-reproduced, cross-platform qualified, released, synchronized to clients,
production-verified, and recursively reconciled.

